.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt REBOOT 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm reboot
.Nd system reset command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
command stops services through
.Xr svcd 8
and requests a normal kernel reset.
It is the administrative form of the same command documented in
.Xr reboot 1 .
.Pp
It requires effective uid 0.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reboot 1 ,
.Xr svcd 8
